<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Tae Kwang Industry H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tae Kwang Industry H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				11,259  vs 9,803</p>
<p>    Net					 12.54  vs 10.91</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		     33.28  vs 19.52</p>
<p>    Revenue				  577.24  vs 528.40</p>
<p>NOTE - Tae Kwang Industry Co Ltd is South Korea's second-largest acrylic yarn maker and also produces such electric goods as amplifiers, cassette recorders and TVs. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
